      "writtenOn": "2026-03-04T18:39:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While this works, is there any chance we can instead do the 5-way to make it an std::span?\n\n 1 - (dawn) add noop virtual std::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e GetSource()\n 2 - (chromium) add actual virtual std::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e GetSource()\n 3 - (dawn) use std::span\u003cuint8_t\u003e GetSource() and make GetSourceData default to returning GetSource().data()\n 4 - (chromium) remove GetSourceData\n 5 - (dawn) remove GetSourceData",
      "revId": "7fd530c014bc1b0f0bcdbd373427b1b0565f082b",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
